              "quote": "78270 An additional amount for housing costs should not be allowed for\n\n\n1. HB expenditure1 or\n\n\n2. claimants in a care home, unless their absence from the dwelling normally occupied as their home is\n\ntemporary2 (see DMG 78240 et seq)",
              "record_id": "https://chris-page-gov.github.io/okf-dwp/id/page/78/0058",
              "record_provenance_sha256": "ba2d9bf6ffdf5ea822d0b808770166b40734475ad901ba005acc7d8ad51855ba",
