          "claim_id": "C3",
          "explanation": "The quoted DMG 78270 supports the main statement. The additional 13-week and 52-week references have selected support at Chapter 78 pages53 and55–57 but are not included in the claim’s explicit evidence list. They remain conditional branches, not an unconditional period for every care-home absence.",
          "human_acceptance": "pending",
          "scope_or_qualification": "This concerns only the housing-cost additional amount, not the whole award. The temporary-absence rules are separate: trial periods of up to 13 weeks under DMG 78240, and 52-week absences under DMG 78254–78257. This paragraph says nothing about funding of care-home fees.",
